        <activityName xml:lang="en">Reinforcing steel, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Reinforcing steel, at regional storage
Represents market of reinforcing steel in Switzerland. Storage volume is assumed to remain constant over time. 45% of reinforcing steel is imported mainly from D, FR, IT and PL, 55% is produced in CH. The transportation of the imports is taken into account in the corresponding sub-process. It is assumed that the locally produced steel will be transported by train at an average distance of 90 kilometres in Switzerland.  
UUID: 36f49fc8-c223-3f57-82e4-aef9bab9ee05
Location: Data relate to plants in Switzerland and Europe
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 
Sampling: Data from literature
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: 
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_36f49fc8-c223-3f57-82e4-aef9bab9ee05.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
